e portal stayed open he says the  constant emp wave grew and encompassed  the entire planet and beyond sending the  earth into darkness the sky literally  began to fall everything stopped from  powered suits to switches machines  sustaining life artificial life you know  even web shoes like the web shooters of  peter parker it all ended and so peter  parker is able to get right back to  where mary jane and and the kids are  supposed to be at least where his  daughter is supposed to be but when he  gets there the building is completely  and totally covered in rubble you do  have luke cage and you do have jessica  jones but what jessica jones says is  that like mary jane was in there trying  to get people out right she was trying  to help the last of the people evacuate  the building when the whole thing came  crumbling down and so in essence it  looks like peter parker's lost mary jane  watson but the crazy thing is he starts  digging through this rubble and when he  does what he finds is his daughter had  actually saved him which is adorable  it's god it's amazing  it's so cool his little girl's just  standing there she's like yeah  she's like holding up all this rubble  and everything which is really really  cool and of course you know that means  mary jane watson's life is effectively  safe but the cool thing about this and  this is this is what's this is what's  wild here right this is this is this is  what really got me into this because i  was like oh my god this is nuts so what  we're told is we jump forward seven  years and peter says seven years ago the  world we knew ended we built another  world a world to be proud of but years  after the lights went out after the end  came the apocalypse that like apocalypse  himself has basically marshaled his own  horsemen and in doing so is sending them  forward into the world presumably with  the intention of conquering it and  that's the thing these aren't just  regular four horsemen these are like  reed richards and like she-hulk and all  that stuff it's cool i would do this the  rest of this story is phenomenal it's  like one of the best stories some of the  best some of the best writing that  marvel's done in quite some time but  with that being said guys we're gonna  bring this to an end thank you all for  watching and i will catch you all later  peace  you
 

